.git
.github
beta-src/node_modules
beta-src/build
node_modules
# The board is built by the beta-build stage in the Dockerfile. A copy left over from a local
# `npm run build` must not be shipped instead of it.
beta
vendor
cache
mapstore
datc/maps
# Compiled variant data is built against a particular database. Shipping a copy from whatever
# machine did the build would leave the image thinking the map was already installed, and a fresh
# database would end up with no territories at all.
variants/*/cache
errorlog
errorlogs
orderlog
orderlogs
config.php
# The macOS launcher apps belong on the user's Mac, not inside the container.
mac
*.md
!README.md
doc/*.png
doc/*.pdf
doc/*.xcf
doc/*.pub
gamemaster-entrypoint.txt
dump.rdb
